#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:6
#: ef5241c477704df5adcd78720921030a
msgid "EKF3 Affinity and Lane Switching"
msgstr "EKF3 亲和性与通道切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:8
#: 5568c140f5bb4f58b766efa8e60b0981
msgid ""
"The :ref:`EKF <dev:extended-kalman-filter>` instantiates multiple instances "
"of the filter called 'lanes'. The primary lane is the one that provides "
"state estimates, rest are updated in the background and available for "
"switching to. The number of possible lanes is exactly equal to the number of"
" IMUs enabled for use. Conventionally, each lane uses the primary instance "
"of the Airspeed, Barometer, GPS and Magnetometer sensors. The primary sensor"
" can be set as a user-modifiable parameter, but can be later changed by the "
"system, even in-flight, in case of a driver-level fault. However, modern-day"
" vehicles are known to have multiple sensors installed of good quality. "
"Affinity is a way for the EKF lanes to use non-primary sensors within any "
"running lane. This provides a statistically consistent way to make use of "
"multiple high quality sensors and use lane-switching to select the lane "
"which has best performing combination of sensors. The lane error score takes"
" into account innovations from all sensors used by a lane. This way, the "
"vehicle can be saved from mishaps using noisy non-IMU sensors as well."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EKF <dev:extended-kalman-filter>` "
"实例化了多个滤波器实例，称为「通道」。主通道提供状态估计，其余通道在后台更新，随时可切换使用。可用通道数量等于启用的 IMU "
"数量。通常，每个通道使用空速、气压计、GPS "
"和磁力计传感器的主实例。主传感器可通过用户可修改的参数设置，但在驱动层面发生故障时系统可在飞行中更改。然而，现代飞行器通常安装有多个高质量传感器。亲和性是让"
" EKF "
"通道在任意运行通道中使用非主传感器的一种方式。这提供了统计上一致的方法来利用多个高质量传感器，并通过通道切换选择传感器组合性能最佳的通道。通道误差分数综合考虑了该通道所有传感器的新息。这样，飞行器也可以避免由噪声较大的非"
" IMU 传感器引起的事故。"

