#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:26
#: 3ef112ff4e8e438b9cfcba9d62cd3233
msgid "Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "配置参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:30
#: 7562131baaf54ac78003defdd32211b1
msgid ""
"Affinity is only available with EKF3, so make sure you are using it by "
"ensuring :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` is set to \"1\" and "
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` is set to \"3\""
msgstr ""
"亲和性仅适用于 EKF3，请确保通过将 :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` 设置为「1」，将 "
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` 设置为「3」来启用 EKF3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:32
#: 25e879c3b87a4d6998041060f0c3c802
msgid ""
"The :ref:`EK3_AFFINITY <EK3_AFFINITY>` parameter is a bitmask which gives "
"you the option to choose the sensors you want to enable affinity for. Non-"
"enabled will follow the default primary sensor allotment."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_AFFINITY <EK3_AFFINITY>` "
"参数是一个位掩码，可选择要启用亲和性的传感器。未启用的传感器将遵循默认主传感器分配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:34
#: 56f8a6f0472c44c8b15478552f952e21
msgid ""
"The :ref:`EK3_ERR_THRESH <EK3_ERR_THRESH>` parameter controls the "
"sensitivity of lane switching. Lane errors are accumulated over time "
"relative to the active primary lane. This threshold controls how much of an "
"error difference between a non-primary and primary lane is required to "
"consider the former performing better. Lowering this parameter makes lane "
"switching more responsive to smaller 'relative' errors, and in practical you"
" will see a more aggressive lane switching, and, vice-versa."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_ERR_THRESH <EK3_ERR_THRESH>` "
"参数控制通道切换的灵敏度。通道误差相对于活跃主通道随时间累积。该阈值控制非主通道与主通道之间需要多大的误差差值才认为前者表现更好。降低该参数会使通道切换对较小的「相对」误差更敏感，实际上会看到更积极的通道切换，反之亦然。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:38
#: 501858bd09e64e1ba14e5373c13bc658
msgid ""
"Misconfiguring the :ref:`EK3_ERR_THRESH <EK3_ERR_THRESH>` parameter could "
"adversely affect the lane switching mechanism and have serious consequences "
"which could lead to the loss of your vehicle. Please tune carefully."
msgstr ""
"错误配置 :ref:`EK3_ERR_THRESH <EK3_ERR_THRESH>` "
"参数可能会对通道切换机制产生不利影响，并产生严重后果，可能导致飞行器丢失。请谨慎调参。"

