#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:47
#: b2ad3c87d7434990a3527b527fd6f8c9
msgid "AIRSPEED"
msgstr "AIRSPEED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:48
#: af59411d1c4340278d13a7d34a8532e5
msgid ""
"An example of lane switching for a plane with 2 airspeed sensors and "
"airspeed affinity enabled. There are 2 IMUs, hence 2 active lanes. The "
"primary lane's airspeed sensor has failed to show changes in pressure, hence"
" reporting a constant value. The speed of the plane is increased and a lane "
"switch occurs. Similarly, the second airspeed sensor of the second lane (now"
" the primary lane) is failed and the plane's speed is decreased which again "
"triggers a lane switch."
msgstr ""
"一个具有 2 个空速传感器且启用空速亲和性的固定翼飞行器通道切换示例。有 2 个 IMU，因此有 2 "
"个活跃通道。主通道的空速传感器失效，无法显示气压变化，持续报告恒定值。飞机速度增加后触发通道切换。类似地，第二通道（现为主通道）的第二个空速传感器失效，飞机速度降低再次触发通道切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:53
#: 28ea164f75bd407980396c882ea1ef83
msgid "BAROMETER"
msgstr "BAROMETER"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:54
#: 96e4561e23884f8ea54b73e388c0fbdf
msgid ""
"An example of lane switching for a plane with 2 barometers and barometer "
"affinity enabled. There are 2 IMUs, hence 2 active lanes. The primary lane's"
" barometer has failed to show changes in pressure, hence reporting a "
"constant value. The altitude of the plane is increased and a lane switch "
"occurs. Similarly, the second barometer of the second lane (now the primary "
"lane) is failed and the plane's altitude is decreased which again triggers a"
" lane switch."
msgstr ""
"一个具有 2 个气压计且启用气压计亲和性的固定翼飞行器通道切换示例。有 2 个 IMU，因此有 2 "
"个活跃通道。主通道的气压计失效，无法显示气压变化，持续报告恒定值。飞机高度增加后触发通道切换。类似地，第二通道（现为主通道）的第二个气压计失效，飞机高度降低再次触发通道切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:59
#: f88cf6fdd8014167a85e597aa4723324
msgid "GPS"
msgstr "GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:60
#: cd626761a83541b1a2134e428efe49f1
msgid ""
"An example of lane switching for a plane with 2 GPS and GPS affinity "
"enabled. There are 2 IMUs, hence 2 active lanes. The primary lane's GPS is "
"simulated with a random GPS Velocity Noise of range ±2m in all 3-axis. The "
"actual speed can be tracked with the 2nd GPS. Subsequently, the EKF primary "
"lane starts reporting a consistently high error and a lane switch occurs "
"when the error crosses the set threshold."
msgstr ""
"一个具有 2 个 GPS 且启用 GPS 亲和性的固定翼飞行器通道切换示例。有 2 个 IMU，因此有 2 个活跃通道。主通道的 GPS 以 ±2m "
"的随机 GPS 速度噪声在所有 3 轴进行仿真。实际速度可通过第 2 个 GPS 跟踪。随后，EKF "
"主通道开始持续报告高误差，误差超过设定阈值时触发通道切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:66
#: 3d418435ea1d47c0b146de6ae009bde7
msgid "MAGNETOMETER"
msgstr "MAGNETOMETER"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:67
#: 8ffbf91751484102893739550e66fc02
msgid ""
"An example of lane switching for a plane with 2 Magnetometers and "
"magnetometer affinity enabled. There are 2 IMUs, hence 2 active lanes. An "
"error is simulated in the primary lane's magnetometer by changing the offset"
" of the z-axis while flying. The offset change can be tracked with the 2nd "
"magnetometer. Subsequently, the EKF primary lane starts reporting a "
"consistently high error and a lane switch occurs when the error crosses the "
"set threshold."
msgstr ""
"一个具有 2 个磁力计且启用磁力计亲和性的固定翼飞行器通道切换示例。有 2 个 IMU，因此有 2 个活跃通道。通过在飞行时更改主通道磁力计的 Z "
"轴偏移量来模拟误差，偏移量变化可通过第 2 个磁力计跟踪。随后，EKF 主通道开始持续报告高误差，误差超过设定阈值时触发通道切换。"
